+// EnsureCreationNotice sends the thread creation notice for a normal (non-forum) thread,
+// if it hasn't been sent yet. Unlike forum posts, normal threads already have a root
+// (the bridged root message), so the notice is a plain in-thread notice message and is
+// not part of root election: failing to send it never invalidates the thread.
+func (thread *Thread) EnsureCreationNotice(ctx context.Context) error {
